V2.0                                                                      4-OCT-2026 19:56:48  DUA1:[000000]FORTH.MAR;2          (1)

                          0086   30  079F  1376 	BSBW	PRSTR
              50   000002F2'EF   9E  07A2  1377 	MOVAB	DUNNO_MSG,R0		; then, ": not found"
                          007C   30  07A9  1378 	BSBW	PRSTR
                          F901   31  07AC  1379 	BRW	ABORT
