                                     09E0  1598 ;
                                     09E0  1599 ; mkhead--build the header of a new word, named by the next word of
                                     09E0  1600 ;   input, with SFP R4 and SFA R5, and make it the latest. Its PFA is
                                     09E0  1601 ;   HERE when the header's done.
